  "answer": "If Corvina cancels your flight, you have two main choices: you can request a full refund, which will be processed within 7 days, or you can choose to be rebooked on the next available Corvina flight. If the next available flight departs more than 24 hours after your original departure, you may also request rebooking on a partner airline. Additionally, you may be eligible for compensation based on the distance band of your flight, unless certain exceptions apply as outlined in the policy. While waiting for an alternative flight, you will also receive care as described in S06.",
